Ghungroo Guitar Chords with strumming pattern sung by Arijit Singh and Shilpa Rao from Bollywood Hindi movie WAR.

Strumming Pattern: D UDUD UDUD DU

Capo on 2nd fret

{c: Intro}
[Am] [D] [Em],        [G] [Am]
[C] [Em] [D]

[Am]Kyun lamhe kha [Em]rab karein,        [G]Aa ghalti behi [D]sab karein
[Am]Do pal ki jo [Em]neend udi,        Aa [G]poore saare [D]khaab karein

Kya [Am]karne hai umron ke [C]waade,        Ye jo [Em]rehte hain rehne de [D]aadhe
Do [Am]baar nahi ik [Em]baar sahi,        Ik [G]raat ki kar le tu [D]yaari

Subah tak [Am]maan ke meri [C]baat,        Tu aise [Em]zor se naachi [F#m]aaj
Ki [B]ghungroo [Am]toot gaye [B],        Ki ghungroo [Em]toot gaye [D]

Chhod ke [Am]saare sharm aur [B]laaj,        Main aise [Em]zor se naachi [D]aaj
Ki ghungroo [Am]toot gaye [C],        Ki [D]ghungroo [Em]toot gaye ae [D]e

[Am] Kya karne hai umron ke [C]waade,        Ye jo [G]rehte hain rehne de [D]aadhe
Do [C]baar nahi ik baar [G]sahi,        Ik raat ki kar le tu [D]yaari

Subah tak [Am]thaam ke tera [C]haath,        Main aise [Em]zor se nachi [D]aaj
Ki ghungroo [Am]toot gaye [C],        Ke [D]ghungroo [Em]toot gaye ae [D]e [Am]ae [C]
Ki [D]ghungroo [Em]toot gaye..[D]
